THE PER-ROW QUANTITIES THE BODY STATES UNIFORMLY
  m = 827 with blocks (24,24): e(G[R]) = 35 (= C(9,2) - 1), e(H[R]) = 1, theta(H) <= 24 + theta(H[R]) = 32, so four triangles give 28 < 29
  m = 828 with blocks (24,24): e(G[R]) = 36 (= C(9,2) - 0), e(H[R]) = 0, theta(H) <= 24 + theta(H[R]) = 33, so four triangles give 29 = 29, no contradiction

